WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.800
Ten runs printed what they found.

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:08.600
And nothing about what they looked for.

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:12.100
The spec asked for this on day one.

4
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.700
The numbers in brackets are the note.

5
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.200
So keep the answer beside the path.

6
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:23.000
404 is a fact about them, not about us.

7
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Four silences. No two alike.

8
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Our gap and theirs are different findings.

9
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.600
The first thing it caught was itself.

10
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:37.000
A page nobody had opened. One run.

11
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.700
Then: Basecamp publishes no changelog.

12
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.700
Three paths, three answers, all checkable.

13
00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:48.000
And Linear had one we never read.

14
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.000
It answered 200 for six runs.

15
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.300
Which page it is comes first now.

16
00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:57.300
Say what you checked. It finds things.
